---
kind: lore
id: isles.tablets
title: The Sunfall tablets
series: islesTablets
---

// AREA isles: three stone tablets, one on each island; the engine shows them
// when the player examines the stone. Page order is file order.

<entry id="islesTablet1" target="item.tabletEmberkey" category="codex" title="The first tablet">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: "The first fire is the mountain's. Keep it and the ships come home."
</entry>

<entry id="islesTablet2" target="item.tabletMistral" category="codex" title="The second tablet" when="entry.islesTablet1.read">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: "The second fire is the wind's. It will not burn facing the wrong way."
</entry>

<entry id="islesTablet3" target="item.tabletCoralreach" category="codex" title="The third tablet" when="entry.islesTablet2.read">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: "The third fire is the sea's. When the three fires meet, the door remembers."
</entry>
